    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "C24D2E51CE0315CB",
      "text": "Bei deinem Kampf gegen Jo stand mein innerer\\nHerd volle Kanne auf Stichflamme![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C24D2F51CE03177E",
      "text": "Wie du ihn einfach in die Pfanne gehauen hast,\\nobwohl ihn sonst niemand besiegen konnte,\\r\\nseit er aus Kitakami zurückgekommen war...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C24D3051CE031931",
      "text": "Das sollte der Blaubeer-Liga genügend Treibstoff\\nfür die nächsten paar Jahre geliefert haben![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C24D3151CE031AE4",
      "text": "Und da du jetzt Champ bist, wodurch Jo zurück\\nin die Top Vier befördert wird...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C24D3251CE031C97",
      "text": "...fliegt das schwächste Top-Vier-Mitglied raus,\\num ihm Platz zu machen. Und das bin leider ich![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "3E4ABBAA2F752252",
      "text": "Hm, bist du dir sicher?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "3E4ABAAA2F75209F",
      "text": "Das tut mir leid!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C24D3351CE031E4A",
      "text": "Ja, echt ein Jammer! Aber so lauten eben die\\nRegeln.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C24D3451CE031FFD",
      "text": "Immerhin herrscht in der Liga-AG jetzt nicht mehr\\nso eine gedrückte Stimmung. Das ist es absolut\\r\\nwert, wenn du mich fragst.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C24D2551CE030680",
      "text": "Mir ist wichtig, dass du weißt, wie dankbar ich\\ndir dafür bin, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
