    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "9364298E4642F873",
      "text": "Und wie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "93642A8E4642FA26",
      "text": "Nicht wirklich.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "EE5436582F6D2814",
      "text": "Wirklich? Das freut mich!\\c\\nKein Wunder, dass du das feurig-scharfe Sandwich\\nohne große Probleme zubereiten konntest.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "6640CDD8967BC082",
      "text": "Nicht wirklich?!\\c\\nDabei hast du das feurig-scharfe Sandwich doch\\nohne größere Probleme zubereitet![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "EE5439582F6D2D2D",
      "text": "Für mich gibt’s nichts Besseres als das Kochen!\\nIch schlepp schließlich nicht umsonst immer\\r\\neine Pfanne mit mir rum.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "EE5438582F6D2B7A",
      "text": "Meine Familie führt ein Restaurant, weißt du?\\nUnd ich will es irgendwann übernehmen.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "EE5433582F6D22FB",
      "text": "Eigentlich bin ich auch nur an der Akademie,\\nweil der Direktor auf mich aufmerksam geworden\\r\\nist und mich angeworben hat![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "EE5432582F6D2148",
      "text": "Deshalb war ich total von den Socken, als ich\\ndeine Kämpfe gegen Jo und Levy gesehen hab...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "EE5435582F6D2661",
      "text": "Die beiden waren mit Feuer und Flamme bei der\\nSache, voller Leidenschaft![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "EE5434582F6D24AE",
      "text": "Schon krass, wie sehr Pokémon-Kämpfe die\\nLeute mitreißen können, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "EE542F582F6D1C2F",
      "text": "Vielleicht muss ich die Glut in meinem Herd auch\\nmal wieder ein bisschen öfter entfachen.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
